    "Name": "Yellow Jacket YJ-58W",
    "Details": "The Yellow Jacket was built around the Poland Model C Gauss rifle. Subsequent version mounted other system, but it remained centered around as single heavy weapon. Though not as fast as most VTOLs, the Yellow Jacket still has greater speed than most BattleMechs and OmniMechs. The long range weapons, respectable speed and relatively heavy armor keep the vehicle safer than many of it's peers.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 7/11 hexes / 210/330 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Heavy Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       140     15\n<b>Left</b>          85     15\n<b>Right</b>        85     15\n<b>Rear</b>         60     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      385     75</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Breaching Shot</color>",
